#: ui/templates/ui/metric_change.html:5
msgid "Change the optimized metric?"
msgstr "¿Cambiar la métrica optimizada?"

#: ui/templates/ui/metric_change.html:8
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"    These trials were chosen to optimize <strong>%(current)s</strong>. "
"Their\n"
"    scores for <strong>%(chosen)s</strong> were recorded too, so the search\n"
"    continues from them rather than starting over — but they are still a "
"sample\n"
"    the old objective picked, and the run inherits that bias.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Estas pruebas se eligieron para optimizar <strong>%(current)s</strong>. "
"También se\n"
"    registraron sus puntuaciones para <strong>%(chosen)s</strong>, así que "
"la búsqueda\n"
"    continúa a partir de ellas en vez de empezar de cero — pero siguen "
"siendo una\n"
"    muestra que eligió el objetivo antiguo, y la ejecución hereda ese "
"sesgo.\n"
"    "

#: ui/templates/ui/metric_change.html:34
#, python-format
msgid "Optimize %(chosen)s"
msgstr "Optimizar %(chosen)s"

#: ui/templates/ui/metric_change.html:35
#, python-format
msgid "Keep optimizing %(current)s"
msgstr "Seguir optimizando %(current)s"

